      "writtenOn": "2018-09-10T15:50:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I might be missing something here, but currently we don\u0027t depend on interrupt to identify the lid state on nocturne. Instead we have the differed task scheduled after every |DEFAULT_POLL_TIMEOUT_US|. When you force a state, you bail out without scheduling the differed task again. SO effectively |base_detect_deferred| should not be called again when the state is forced.  I see a bug to make this interrupt based (b/74239259).",
